  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding and Social Cohesion in New Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a peacebuilding programme for the new Sudan. Starting in Darfur It will support the Sudanese Government to build peace the root causes of conflict, and rebuild the social contract through support to rule of law and provision of basic services</narrative>
  </description>
